1. Browser Back Button 🌐
Jo pages visit karte ho woh stack mein store hote hain.
Back click → last visited page pop().
Example: Google → YouTube → Instagram → Back → YouTube.

2.Undo/Redo in Applications ↩️
Word, VS Code, Photoshop etc. mein actions stack mein store hote hain.
Undo → last action remove (pop()).
Example: Type → Delete → Undo → Delete action reverse.

3.Function Call Stack in Programming 💻
Jab ek function dusre function ko call karta hai, calls stack mein store hote hain.
Last called function pehle complete hota hai.
Isi ko Call Stack kehte hain.

4.Backtracking / Maze Games 🧩
Maze mein jo path follow kiya woh stack mein store kar sakte hain.
Dead end aaya → last position pop() karke backtrack.
Used in maze solving, puzzles, games etc.

5.Text Editor / Bracket Matching 📝
Code editors/compiler mein (), {}, [] jaise brackets check karne ke liye stack use hota hai.
Opening bracket → push()
Closing bracket → pop() and match.